stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING
  PENDING --> RESERVED: Hold succeeds
  PENDING --> CANCELLED: No stock
  RESERVED --> PAYMENT_PENDING
  PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAID: Charge known
  PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_UNCERTAIN: Timeout or outage
  PAYMENT_UNCERTAIN --> PAID: Resolve charged
  PAYMENT_UNCERTAIN --> COMPENSATING: Resolve declined
  PAYMENT_PENDING --> COMPENSATING: Decline
  PAID --> CONFIRMED: Confirm hold
  PAID --> COMPENSATING: Unrecoverable confirmation failure
  COMPENSATING --> CANCELLED: Refund if charged then release
  CONFIRMED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
